<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6350] SQL: Forbid NOT NULL constraints usage for a cache with configured read-through cache store</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6350</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We need to throw an exception when user attempts to create or alter a table with a field declared as NOT NULL in a case the corresponding cache configuration employs read-through cache store &lt;tt&gt;CacheConfiguration.setReadThrough()&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These features seem to not fit together quite well, so we skip the support at the moment and the check will keep things consistent.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
